OL,3,GNEWSACliff horses removed after more
OL,4,Athan 100 years in grazing rights row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHorses which have grazed the cliffs of
OL,7,Fa coastal beauty spot for more than 100
OL,8,Fyears have been removed following a row
OL,9,Fover grazing rights.
OL,11,FThe decision to take the animals off
OL,12,FRhossili Common in Swansea follows
OL,13,Fmonths of disagreement, after concerns
OL,14,Fwere raised about visitor safety and
OL,15,Fthe number of horses grazing the
OL,16,FNational Trust-owned common.
OL,18,FRob Morgan, who runs Rhossili
OL,19,FSunflowers and Gower Fresh Christmas
OL,20,FTrees, shared the news in a video
OL,21,Fposted on social media.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
