OL,3,GNEWSACliff horses removed after more
OL,4,Athan 100 years in grazing rights row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe and fellow farmer Nicky Beynon said
OL,7,Fthey faced increasing "pressure" from
OL,8,FNational Trust Cymru, which said the
OL,9,Fdecision to remove all the horses was
OL,10,F"entirely his" and "at no stage" had
OL,11,Fasked for the horses to be removed.
